{"5043660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DriveGear", "steam_appid": 5043660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5105690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/57aa5a9736e87eb65b6ca00b52638d95.avif?t=1787748204\" width=1280 height=665 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your gear. Climb the circuit. Claim the crown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DriveGear is a single-player spin-combat action roguelite. Battle through each district in a city-wide tournament.  Route your optimal path, take on contracts, tune your build, battle rivals, and earn your way to the Crown Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/b3f499c44017f8bdf1a1f8fc64ba8aa7.webp?t=1787748204\" width=1170 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble your DriveGear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every machine is built from four interchangeable components: Core, Chassis, Axle, and Bearing. Change the way you accelerate, collide, defend, and deploy special abilities by rebuilding between encounters. Build for attack, defense, or stamina, or find that killer combination of parts across three specialized part lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/247c20002e163176bc59ee203b66915b.avif?t=1787748204\" width=469 height=584 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/b3f499c44017f8bdf1a1f8fc64ba8aa7.webp?t=1787748204\" width=1170 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control Every Clash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash attack an open opponent, guard through pressure, and utilize build dependent special moves and abilities.  Find the right timing and openings to defeat difficult opponents or finish in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/c4bda7203090c1df876ba724d7e5ffa4.avif?t=1787748204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras_big/c4bda7203090c1df876ba724d7e5ffa4.webp?t=1787748204 width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/b3f499c44017f8bdf1a1f8fc64ba8aa7.webp?t=1787748204\" width=1170 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Route Under Pressure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout branching paths across each district. Contracts, vendors, events, and fights all compete for limited time. A risky detour can secure a badge, reveal a stronger part, or leave you scrambling to reach the qualifier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/1bd298913690c9d217bc00a3d7457a2e.avif?t=1787748204\" width=712 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/b3f499c44017f8bdf1a1f8fc64ba8aa7.webp?t=1787748204\" width=1170 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reshape your gear as you move across the districts. Claim gear spoils from defeated rivals. Buy parts, upgrades, and badges at vendors.  Complete contracts to earn credits for vital new parts.  Every encounter is an opportunity to push your build even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/1cf29ae28660dc061ca6ab4076b5ef6c.avif?t=1787748204\" width=1171 height=610 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/b3f499c44017f8bdf1a1f8fc64ba8aa7.webp?t=1787748204\" width=1170 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Claim the Crown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every district brings it's own local flair, changing the opposition and the arena around you. Route through the new environments, adapt to the rivals, and make them remember your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/30b017dbb5884059ed6919ef05aac05c.avif?t=1787748204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras_big/30b017dbb5884059ed6919ef05aac05c.webp?t=1787748204 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043660/extras/57aa5a9736e87eb65b6ca00b52638d95.avif?t=1787748204\" width=1280 height=665 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your gear. Climb the circuit. Claim the crown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DriveGear is a single-player spin-combat action roguelite. Battle through each district in a city-wide tournament.  Route your optimal path, take on contracts, tune your build, battle rivals, and 